    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHC6DA208AF408F058E2D2250F56221D9B" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p class="MsoNormal">Beginning October 1, 1986 respondent began providing transmission services for various New England Utilities, pursuant to &#8220;Phase I Vermont Transmission Line Support Agreement&#8221; dated December 1981 (FERC Rate Schedule No. 2). The utilities paying support charges are as follows:</p>
        <p class="MsoNormal">
          <img title="VETCO Page 328 Note.jpg" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," alt="" width="557" height="312" />
        </p>
      </div>
